sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as Client_RustOrTS
  participant TxBuilder as sui_transaction_builder
  participant Signer as ClientSigner
  participant Rpc as sui_json_rpc
  participant Orch as sui_core::TransactionOrchestrator
  participant Auth as sui_core::AuthorityState
  participant Exec as sui_execution::Executor
  participant Store as sui_storage
  participant Indexer as sui_indexer_alt

  Note over Client,TxBuilder: Build
  Client->>TxBuilder: 查询对象/选gas/组PTB
  TxBuilder-->>Client: TransactionData_bytes

  Note over Client,Signer: Sign
  Client->>Signer: sign(TransactionData)
  Signer-->>Client: signatures + Transaction

  Note over Client,Rpc: Submit
  Client->>Rpc: executeTransactionBlock(tx_bytes,sigs)

  Note over Rpc,Orch: DriveToFinality
  Rpc->>Orch: execute_transaction_block(request)
  Orch->>Auth: submit/execute_path

  Note over Auth,Exec: Execute
  Auth->>Exec: execute_transaction_to_effects
  Exec->>Store: read/write objects, effects, events
  Store-->>Exec: ok
  Exec-->>Auth: effects/events
  Auth-->>Orch: response

  Note over Orch,Rpc: Return
  Orch-->>Rpc: ExecuteTransactionResponse
  Rpc-->>Client: SuiTransactionBlockResponse

  Note over Store,Indexer: Index
  Store-->>Indexer: checkpoints/effects/events stream
  Indexer-->>Client: query/read services